WEBVTT

01:49.160 --> 01:50.200
So you're Xing Wu?

01:51.920 --> 01:53.120
I'm Ye's father.

01:54.200 --> 01:55.560
Tomorrow I'm taking her away.

01:58.520 --> 01:59.160
I know.

02:01.080 --> 02:02.720
I came to you because I need

02:02.760 --> 02:03.760
a favor.

02:04.960 --> 02:05.560
Go ahead.

02:06.640 --> 02:07.880
After Ye goes back to Beijing,

02:08.759 --> 02:09.520
I don't want you two

02:09.560 --> 02:10.759
to have any contact.

02:15.200 --> 02:16.720
You shouldn't be asking me this.

02:17.560 --> 02:19.440
She's free to decide

02:20.440 --> 02:21.440
who she keeps in touch with.

02:26.280 --> 02:27.240
She's my daughter.

02:29.000 --> 02:30.160
As her father,

02:30.560 --> 02:32.079
I won't let anyone

02:32.880 --> 02:34.760
get in the way of her bright future.

02:36.920 --> 02:37.800
Ye still has

02:37.800 --> 02:39.200
unrealistic expectations about reality.

02:40.280 --> 02:41.360
But once she's back in Beijing,

02:41.360 --> 02:42.160
she'll realize

02:43.520 --> 02:45.040
you're from different worlds.

02:46.360 --> 02:47.920
As time goes by,

02:48.440 --> 02:49.600
she'll forget about you.

02:50.560 --> 02:51.400
You won't

02:52.040 --> 02:53.440
cross paths again in the future.

02:57.960 --> 02:58.920
It's fine if she forgets.

02:59.800 --> 03:01.040
As long as she's doing well.

03:03.440 --> 03:04.520
If there's nothing else,

03:05.720 --> 03:06.400
I'll head off.

03:15.960 --> 03:16.520
Mr. Qing,

03:17.680 --> 03:18.600
after Qing Ye goes back,

03:19.880 --> 03:21.320
please spend more time

03:21.320 --> 03:21.920
with her.

03:23.040 --> 03:23.920
She's strong

03:24.520 --> 03:25.320
and independent,

03:27.120 --> 03:28.280
but she also gets lonely.

03:30.400 --> 03:31.960
She needs her family to love her.

04:04.680 --> 04:05.960
Leaving so suddenly.

04:07.400 --> 04:08.560
I didn't prepare anything.

04:10.200 --> 04:11.520
Don't even have anything decent

04:11.520 --> 04:12.160
to give you.

04:15.800 --> 04:17.399
Your hairdressing skills are decent.

04:18.680 --> 04:20.360
Just give me a nice hairstyle.

04:21.200 --> 04:21.760
That'd be perfect.

04:23.040 --> 04:24.000
You're so sweet.

04:26.160 --> 04:27.440
I had hair as nice as yours

04:28.520 --> 04:31.160
when I was young.

04:34.120 --> 04:35.800
You must've been beautiful back then.

04:37.440 --> 04:38.360
Not really.

04:39.040 --> 04:40.120
But I was stupid.

04:42.240 --> 04:43.320
Back then,

04:43.600 --> 04:44.720
I was dating a guy

04:44.840 --> 04:46.520
my mom didn't approve of.

04:46.960 --> 04:48.120
Your mom also told me

04:48.560 --> 04:50.080
to break up with him.

04:50.840 --> 04:51.720
But I wouldn't listen.

04:52.200 --> 04:53.400
I thought they didn't know anything.

04:54.159 --> 04:55.240
They didn't get me.

04:55.920 --> 04:57.159
They didn't understand love.

04:57.880 --> 04:58.920
So I got mad

04:59.200 --> 05:00.760
and ran off with that guy.

05:02.240 --> 05:02.920
And

05:03.520 --> 05:04.040
I ended up

05:04.040 --> 05:05.560
like this.

05:10.160 --> 05:11.440
I regret it so much.

05:13.400 --> 05:14.280
But life

05:15.400 --> 05:16.840
doesn't give you do-overs.

05:20.440 --> 05:21.840
Don't be mad at your dad.

05:23.720 --> 05:24.920
Don't choose the wrong path

05:25.960 --> 05:27.040
just out of spite.

05:28.240 --> 05:29.160
No parent

05:29.920 --> 05:30.760
in this world

05:31.160 --> 05:32.400
would harm their own child.

05:40.440 --> 05:42.120
How do I know what the right choice is?

05:54.720 --> 05:55.240
Come on.

05:56.760 --> 05:57.680
Let me see.

06:00.880 --> 06:01.360
Okay.

06:02.600 --> 06:04.720
Go home with your dad.

06:06.520 --> 06:07.640
You'll have a big house

06:08.400 --> 06:10.000
and pretty clothes.

06:10.720 --> 06:12.200
When you want to study,

06:12.640 --> 06:14.080
you can study.

06:14.520 --> 06:15.680
When you want to have fun,

06:16.160 --> 06:17.160
you can have fun.

06:18.440 --> 06:20.720
You'll never have to worry about money.

06:21.400 --> 06:23.520
That's the right choice.

06:28.520 --> 06:29.120
Done.

06:33.360 --> 06:34.080
Auntie.

06:36.720 --> 06:38.360
This hairstyle looks really good.

06:41.200 --> 06:42.040
My skills

06:42.760 --> 06:43.560
are

06:43.800 --> 06:45.120
pretty solid.

06:48.040 --> 06:49.200
Ye, you look beautiful.

09:44.880 --> 09:45.480
You're awake.

09:55.280 --> 09:56.600
I woke up as soon as you came in.

09:59.960 --> 10:00.440
I...

10:01.440 --> 10:02.640
got you some candied hawthorn.

10:03.960 --> 10:05.280
I'm leaving tomorrow.

10:14.440 --> 10:15.440
I heard.

10:20.840 --> 10:21.640
This is the last night.

10:23.200 --> 10:24.400
I wanted to do something.

10:25.640 --> 10:26.480
It feels like

10:27.760 --> 10:28.920
a waste

10:30.480 --> 10:31.600
to just sleep through it.

10:38.960 --> 10:39.960
What do you wanna do?

10:41.320 --> 10:41.960
I'm with you.

10:57.840 --> 10:59.120
This is the first time

10:59.920 --> 11:00.880
in so long

11:02.320 --> 11:03.040
I've just

11:04.120 --> 11:05.120
quietly watched

11:05.720 --> 11:07.280
the sea in Zhazhating.

11:09.480 --> 11:10.200
Like an oil painting.

11:12.360 --> 11:13.240
It looks more like

11:14.160 --> 11:15.200
a circuit board.

11:17.240 --> 11:18.320
How?

11:18.880 --> 11:19.840
You're killing the mood.

11:23.240 --> 11:23.920
Look over there.

11:25.440 --> 11:26.240
I used to

11:27.160 --> 11:28.400
climb up there all the time as a kid.

11:30.280 --> 11:32.480
Your secret base?

11:34.160 --> 11:34.720
Kind of.

11:35.360 --> 11:36.880
Back then, Xing Guodong had a bad temper

11:37.360 --> 11:38.000
and always hit people.

11:38.800 --> 11:39.720
So I'd

11:39.720 --> 11:40.800
sneak far away by myself

11:41.720 --> 11:42.720
and climb up there.

11:43.400 --> 11:44.520
He wouldn't find you?

11:45.240 --> 11:45.680
No.

11:46.200 --> 11:47.160
Never.

11:48.080 --> 11:49.280
I used to sit up there

11:49.280 --> 11:50.080
for the whole day.

11:50.880 --> 11:51.840
Until the sun

11:52.200 --> 11:53.560
slowly set,

11:54.120 --> 11:55.000
the fishing boats came back,

11:55.520 --> 11:56.680
and the sky got dark.

11:59.880 --> 12:00.560
Weren't you scared?

12:00.920 --> 12:01.480
I was.

12:02.000 --> 12:03.200
I was terrified as a kid.

12:03.640 --> 12:04.640
I didn't feel it while climbing up.

12:05.280 --> 12:06.320
But it was windy out there.

12:07.160 --> 12:08.280
And then I was too scared to climb down.

12:08.640 --> 12:09.080
So...

12:09.600 --> 12:11.120
So what did you do? Then what?

12:11.280 --> 12:12.040
So I'd wait.

12:12.760 --> 12:13.520
Wait until it got dark.

12:14.320 --> 12:15.480
Wait until the lighthouse lit up.

12:15.840 --> 12:17.840
I thought that light was shining for me.

12:18.720 --> 12:19.880
And suddenly, I wasn't scared anymore.

12:24.480 --> 12:26.000
After that, I'd often

12:26.240 --> 12:27.000
climb up there alone

12:27.920 --> 12:29.400
and wait for the lighthouse to light up.

12:33.560 --> 12:34.440
Just like now.

12:36.120 --> 12:36.640
Five.

12:37.280 --> 12:37.840
Four.

12:38.320 --> 12:38.840
Three.

12:39.280 --> 12:39.840
Two.

12:40.840 --> 12:41.320
One.

12:41.800 --> 12:42.320
Light.

12:52.400 --> 12:53.080
It's late.

12:53.840 --> 12:54.360
Light!

13:03.440 --> 13:04.800
Do you know what a lighthouse is for?

13:06.560 --> 13:07.120
Coordinates?

13:07.840 --> 13:08.400
Exactly.

13:09.080 --> 13:10.600
A lighthouse is an important

13:10.680 --> 13:12.600
navigation beacon to guide ships.

13:20.000 --> 13:20.520
Qing Ye.

13:22.200 --> 13:23.640
You're a born explorer.

13:25.120 --> 13:26.160
Time to set sail.

13:27.440 --> 13:29.120
Go conquer your vast ocean.

13:36.840 --> 13:38.520
Zhazhating really has some kind of

13:39.360 --> 13:40.640
invisible pull.

13:43.640 --> 13:45.040
First time I came,

13:46.160 --> 13:47.240
I really wanted to leave.

13:48.520 --> 13:49.880
Second time I came,

13:50.560 --> 13:51.640
I really wanted to stay.

13:52.640 --> 13:53.560
This time,

13:56.120 --> 13:57.360
I think

14:01.360 --> 14:02.000
it'd be great

14:02.000 --> 14:03.320
if you could come with me.

14:12.840 --> 14:13.840
After you leave this time,

14:15.880 --> 14:16.840
don't come back.

14:20.760 --> 14:21.720
Do you remember

14:24.720 --> 14:25.600
what you said to me

14:25.600 --> 14:26.760
that night during New Year's?

14:33.040 --> 14:33.760
I do.

14:34.920 --> 14:36.200
You said wherever I want to go,

14:37.640 --> 14:38.480
you'll be there.

14:44.360 --> 14:45.720
But with my grades right now,

14:48.600 --> 14:49.360
I can't

14:50.000 --> 14:51.040
get into the same university as you,

14:51.040 --> 14:52.080
let alone go abroad.

14:53.040 --> 14:53.880
That's just the truth.

15:07.520 --> 15:08.200
Xing Wu,

15:09.240 --> 15:10.040
I believe in you.

15:11.080 --> 15:12.280
If you really want to go,

15:13.560 --> 15:15.440
there are a million ways to get there.

15:17.800 --> 15:19.320
If you want to see me again,

15:21.320 --> 15:23.200
then walk right up to me yourself.

15:31.760 --> 15:32.320
Okay.

15:34.240 --> 15:35.000
I promise you.

15:46.520 --> 15:49.160
I'll apply to Qingbei University.

15:50.200 --> 15:51.760
I'll cut the distance between us

15:52.840 --> 15:53.760
in half.

15:55.280 --> 15:56.120
The rest

15:59.120 --> 16:00.160
is up to you.

16:08.160 --> 16:08.840
I'll do my best.

16:12.360 --> 16:13.200
Give me your phone.

16:35.920 --> 16:36.600
I'll delete

16:36.600 --> 16:37.800
our contact.

16:40.400 --> 16:41.760
We won't be in touch again

16:44.840 --> 16:46.000
until you catch up to me.

17:26.440 --> 17:27.839
Think of this as motivation.

17:29.200 --> 17:30.680
So you can keep up with me.

17:38.440 --> 17:39.760
I hope the next time

17:39.760 --> 17:40.640
we see each other,

17:42.040 --> 17:43.640
we'll both be at our best.

18:06.200 --> 18:06.880
Qing Ye.

18:10.000 --> 18:11.080
Just keep moving forward.

18:14.000 --> 18:14.880
I'll catch up.

19:12.560 --> 19:13.640
You should head back now.

19:13.960 --> 19:15.120
You've got work tomorrow.

19:19.200 --> 19:20.200
I'll watch you go in,

19:21.320 --> 19:21.960
then I'll leave.

19:37.080 --> 19:38.160
Will you come tomorrow?

19:50.760 --> 19:51.360
Qing Ye.

19:53.600 --> 19:54.400
Don't look back.

22:23.520 --> 22:24.600
Forget it.

22:24.600 --> 22:26.120
You're not helping.

22:27.400 --> 22:28.400
After rushing so much,

22:28.400 --> 22:29.920
this is all I managed to knit.

22:30.560 --> 22:32.280
Qing Ye is leaving first thing tomorrow.

22:32.480 --> 22:33.680
How am I gonna finish in time?

22:34.920 --> 22:36.840
Qing Ye's dad really is something.

22:37.760 --> 22:38.840
Coming so suddenly.

22:39.520 --> 22:40.920
Leaving so suddenly too.

22:41.560 --> 22:42.960
We didn't have any time to prepare.

22:44.920 --> 22:45.680
You know,

22:45.680 --> 22:47.080
Ye never gets to enjoy any comfort

22:47.240 --> 22:48.720
while she's here with us.

22:49.600 --> 22:51.480
Going back with her dad is for the best.

23:46.120 --> 23:46.760
Get in.

23:49.680 --> 23:50.360
Where's your luggage?

23:51.760 --> 23:52.720
It's still early.

23:53.920 --> 23:54.480
Dad.

23:55.680 --> 23:56.920
Let me take you to breakfast.

24:18.840 --> 24:19.560
Here.

24:20.120 --> 24:20.920
Try our signature

24:21.000 --> 24:22.640
seafood noodles.

24:22.720 --> 24:23.320
Thanks.

24:24.520 --> 24:25.240
Thanks.

24:26.360 --> 24:27.480
Let me know if you want anything.

24:28.000 --> 24:28.760
Ye, take your time eating.

24:28.840 --> 24:30.000
Thanks, Auntie Shanxi.

24:34.720 --> 24:35.480
So

24:36.360 --> 24:37.440
the family you're staying with

24:37.440 --> 24:38.360
runs a restaurant.

24:38.920 --> 24:39.400
Yes.

24:40.440 --> 24:43.400
They gave us their house to live in.

24:43.840 --> 24:45.360
They're staying somewhere else for now.

24:47.800 --> 24:49.440
No need to wipe it. It's clean.

24:49.640 --> 24:50.680
Been through the sterilizer.

24:55.320 --> 24:56.880
You used to be such a germaphobe.

24:59.840 --> 25:00.840
This place cures germaphobia.

25:01.480 --> 25:03.000
Stay long enough and you'll get used to it.

25:10.400 --> 25:10.920
See that place

25:10.920 --> 25:12.040
across the way that had a fire?

25:14.040 --> 25:14.800
I used to

25:15.760 --> 25:16.760
live there.

25:20.760 --> 25:22.000
I came here years ago.

25:23.280 --> 25:24.720
Had no idea it turned out like this.

25:25.880 --> 25:26.760
At least you're okay.

25:28.000 --> 25:29.080
When I first came here,

25:31.000 --> 25:32.800
Auntie Lanfang's family cooked with lard.

25:33.600 --> 25:34.320
I couldn't get used to it.

25:35.800 --> 25:36.920
I went hungry for a day.

25:37.160 --> 25:38.400
The first proper meal I had

25:39.080 --> 25:40.360
was at this place.

25:46.000 --> 25:47.240
I've let you down.

25:48.400 --> 25:49.240
You've been through a lot.

25:50.920 --> 25:52.200
Back then, I thought it was really hard.

25:54.480 --> 25:55.440
But looking back now,

25:56.600 --> 25:57.520
I was pretty happy.

26:02.520 --> 26:03.560
Ye, you've grown up.

26:05.000 --> 26:06.120
You're not that little girl

26:06.120 --> 26:07.120
in my eyes anymore.

26:08.280 --> 26:09.880
Living in an environment like this,

26:10.800 --> 26:11.880
you have to learn

26:12.440 --> 26:13.400
to adjust

26:13.680 --> 26:14.480
and find joy in the hardship

26:14.920 --> 26:16.080
to get through the days.

26:16.920 --> 26:18.000
After coming here,

26:19.520 --> 26:20.360
I realized

26:22.200 --> 26:23.480
just how lonely it was

26:24.800 --> 26:26.360
back in Beijing after Mom passed away.

26:38.680 --> 26:39.240
Dad,

26:41.080 --> 26:41.960
would you worry about

26:41.960 --> 26:43.040
whether others have enough to eat

26:44.440 --> 26:45.440
when you're the one

26:45.440 --> 26:46.360
going hungry?

26:49.360 --> 26:49.960
No.

26:54.640 --> 26:55.360
They would.

27:00.880 --> 27:01.440
The day Xing Wu found out

27:01.440 --> 27:02.600
I didn't like lard,

27:04.760 --> 27:06.200
he switched to rapeseed oil.

27:08.240 --> 27:08.960
Also

27:10.600 --> 27:12.000
the bathroom door lock in the backyard,

27:13.160 --> 27:13.800
the wardrobe,

27:14.720 --> 27:16.320
the air conditioner and lights in my room.

27:16.760 --> 27:17.440
Auntie Lanfang was worried

27:17.440 --> 27:18.480
I wasn't getting enough nutrition,

27:19.880 --> 27:20.720
so she kept making

27:20.720 --> 27:21.720
braised pork trotters for me.

27:23.560 --> 27:24.960
Grandma was afraid I'd lose things again,

27:26.160 --> 27:27.040
so she knitted me all kinds of

27:27.040 --> 27:28.120
custom pen cases,

27:29.000 --> 27:29.600
notebook covers,

27:30.320 --> 27:31.040
and laptop sleeves.

27:32.880 --> 27:34.000
These things might be

27:34.000 --> 27:35.040
insignificant to you,

27:36.400 --> 27:37.200
but each one

27:38.280 --> 27:39.160
is a sign of their

27:39.160 --> 27:40.480
wholehearted care for me.

27:42.200 --> 27:43.560
They treat me like family.

27:45.440 --> 27:46.880
And I treat them like family too.

27:49.360 --> 27:50.960
So before I leave,

27:52.920 --> 27:54.640
I want to do something for them.

28:05.280 --> 28:06.280
Dad, try some.

28:07.600 --> 28:09.440
The seafood noodles here are great.

28:11.480 --> 28:12.000
Okay.

28:30.040 --> 28:30.840
Here's a hundred thousand.

28:31.520 --> 28:32.920
Consider this payment

28:32.920 --> 28:33.840
for looking after Ye all this time.

28:34.480 --> 28:35.400
Please, you have to take it.

28:36.880 --> 28:38.280
You've already paid

28:38.280 --> 28:39.520
for that before.

28:39.520 --> 28:40.560
I can't take this.

28:41.240 --> 28:41.720
I still owed you

28:41.720 --> 28:43.000
twenty thousand.

28:44.640 --> 28:46.200
Xuan Island needs repairs.

28:46.840 --> 28:48.080
This hundred thousand should

28:48.080 --> 28:49.280
make things a bit easier for you.

28:50.560 --> 28:51.800
Better to have money than not.

28:56.400 --> 28:56.920
Yes.

28:57.360 --> 28:58.120
You're right.

28:58.560 --> 28:59.840
No one turns down money.

29:00.720 --> 29:01.240
Alright.

29:02.360 --> 29:03.120
I'll take it.

29:03.720 --> 29:05.240
But I need to write you an IOU.

29:25.120 --> 29:27.360
Oone, ten, a hundred, a thousand...

29:35.560 --> 29:35.960
Here.

29:36.640 --> 29:37.120
Take a look.

29:41.640 --> 29:43.280
I didn't mean for you to pay it back.

29:43.920 --> 29:44.640
I know.

29:44.880 --> 29:45.760
But I have to.

29:47.720 --> 29:48.440
I admit,

29:48.760 --> 29:50.320
back then, I looked after Ye

29:50.360 --> 29:51.320
for the money.

29:52.120 --> 29:53.640
But after all this time together,

29:53.640 --> 29:54.640
I've come to think of her

29:54.640 --> 29:55.720
as my own niece.

29:56.520 --> 29:57.200
So thank you

29:57.200 --> 29:58.240
for lending me this money.

29:59.360 --> 30:01.320
Even if it's for Ye's sake,

30:01.720 --> 30:03.480
I have to pay it back.

30:04.000 --> 30:05.280
If I can't in three years, then five.

30:05.760 --> 30:07.240
If not, then seven.

30:07.600 --> 30:08.200
Anyway,

30:09.240 --> 30:10.720
not a single cent less.

30:19.160 --> 30:19.640
Here.

30:19.920 --> 30:20.600
Auntie.

30:23.200 --> 30:23.760
Alright.

30:24.480 --> 30:25.760
No need to see me off.

30:25.960 --> 30:27.360
Otherwise, I won't be able to leave.

30:27.600 --> 30:28.600
Even better.

30:28.640 --> 30:29.680
Just stay in Zhazhating.

30:29.840 --> 30:30.920
I'll cover your room and board.

30:31.480 --> 30:32.120
Stop it.

30:33.200 --> 30:34.160
Can't keep her even if we try.

30:34.560 --> 30:35.840
You'll make us all cry.

30:38.400 --> 30:39.160
Ye,

30:40.400 --> 30:41.400
Grandma and I

30:42.160 --> 30:44.600
wanted to give you something

30:44.640 --> 30:45.840
to remember us by.

30:46.880 --> 30:47.560
But Xuan...

30:48.680 --> 30:49.680
Xuan Island is gone.

30:51.000 --> 30:51.960
So we don't have

30:51.960 --> 30:53.600
anything decent to give you.

30:55.040 --> 30:55.880
I wanted to

30:56.240 --> 30:57.240
knit you a scarf

30:57.240 --> 30:58.880
to keep you warm on the road.

30:59.520 --> 31:01.480
But I'm old. My hands aren't what they were.

31:01.720 --> 31:02.840
Haven't finished it yet.

31:07.080 --> 31:07.760
Grandma.

31:09.200 --> 31:10.840
Grandma, you're not old.

31:11.520 --> 31:13.280
You'll live to a hundred.

31:14.840 --> 31:17.160
I can't possibly live that long.

31:17.880 --> 31:19.080
I say you will, so you will.

31:20.560 --> 31:22.160
Finish knitting my scarf.

31:23.360 --> 31:24.840
I'll come back for it next time.

31:25.560 --> 31:26.040
Okay.

31:26.840 --> 31:28.400
I'll be here waiting for you.

31:29.160 --> 31:30.320
Come back whenever you have time.

31:32.200 --> 31:32.880
Grandma,

31:36.240 --> 31:38.280
I'm going to miss you all so much.

31:39.480 --> 31:40.720
I'll get you

31:40.720 --> 31:41.880
an electric wheelchair

31:42.400 --> 31:43.600
next time I come.

31:45.480 --> 31:46.680
Don't you worry.

31:46.840 --> 31:48.320
This one works just fine.

31:50.160 --> 31:51.440
After you go back,

31:51.760 --> 31:53.880
live your own life well.

32:01.320 --> 32:02.000
Ye.

32:02.960 --> 32:03.600
Time to go.

32:11.720 --> 32:12.240
Go on.

32:13.040 --> 32:14.640
Don't keep your dad waiting.

32:17.000 --> 32:18.080
Don't cry.

32:18.560 --> 32:20.440
Leave with the same smile you came with.

32:21.000 --> 32:22.000
Don't let people think

32:22.280 --> 32:24.240
you were mistreated here.

32:32.800 --> 32:33.320
Okay.

32:34.040 --> 32:34.720
Grandma.

32:35.160 --> 32:36.040
I'm going now.

32:36.040 --> 32:36.560
Okay.

32:37.760 --> 32:38.400
Alright.

32:39.520 --> 32:40.840
Good girl.

32:46.480 --> 32:47.440
Auntie Yufen.

32:48.640 --> 32:49.520
Auntie Shanxi.

32:50.880 --> 32:51.560
Auntie.

32:53.720 --> 32:54.440
I'm leaving.

32:58.360 --> 32:59.000
Kyle.

33:00.160 --> 33:00.880
Big G.

33:04.640 --> 33:05.360
See you next time.

33:07.240 --> 33:07.760
Ye.

33:09.640 --> 33:10.400
You're really leaving?

33:13.080 --> 33:15.160
Can't you stay?

33:15.640 --> 33:17.080
School starts the day after tomorrow.

33:17.120 --> 33:17.520
What's

33:17.520 --> 33:18.920
our squad gonna do without you?

33:20.080 --> 33:20.600
Right.

33:21.600 --> 33:23.000
I already talked to Ye Yingjian.

33:23.880 --> 33:25.520
He'll keep you all studying.

33:26.000 --> 33:26.760
I'll send you

33:26.760 --> 33:28.160
study materials regularly too.

33:30.600 --> 33:31.600
We're all one team.

33:31.920 --> 33:32.800
Don't embarrass me.

33:34.600 --> 33:35.960
Thank you all for taking care of Ye

33:35.960 --> 33:37.000
all this time.

33:37.520 --> 33:38.080
Thank you.

33:39.440 --> 33:40.240
Let's go, Ye.

33:41.480 --> 33:42.720
Go ahead.

33:55.120 --> 33:56.320
Aren't you waiting for Xing Wu?

34:08.199 --> 34:08.880
No.

35:48.960 --> 35:49.880
Your phone's ringing.

36:01.960 --> 36:02.440
Hello?

36:02.880 --> 36:03.440
Wu.

36:03.480 --> 36:04.520
Qing Ye left.

36:04.600 --> 36:05.640
Why didn't you come?

36:27.160 --> 36:28.040
We're having dinner with Mr. Meng

36:28.320 --> 36:29.160
and the others tonight

36:29.160 --> 36:29.960
after we get back.

36:30.440 --> 36:32.040
The house isn't ready yet.

36:32.440 --> 36:33.520
You'll stay at a hotel tonight.

36:35.080 --> 36:36.080
The hotel is already booked.

36:36.800 --> 36:37.680
Pretty close to home.

36:39.480 --> 36:40.760
There are some things at the company

36:40.760 --> 36:41.880
I need to hand over.

36:42.840 --> 36:43.680
For the next few days,

36:43.920 --> 36:45.640
just rest at the hotel.

36:46.960 --> 36:48.440
Starting over won't be easy.

36:49.800 --> 36:51.560
After this, you'll need to

36:51.800 --> 36:53.880
come with me to visit a few elders.

36:54.520 --> 36:55.240
Relationships

36:56.160 --> 36:57.200
need to be maintained.

36:58.760 --> 37:00.440
Don't dwell on the past.

37:47.040 --> 37:48.040
It's getting late.

37:48.520 --> 37:49.880
Let's head straight to the restaurant.

37:50.440 --> 37:52.040
Mrs. Meng and the others are already there.

37:52.280 --> 37:53.360
Said they want to welcome us back.

37:55.240 --> 37:56.080
Do I have to go?

37:57.200 --> 37:58.600
I want to go back to the hotel and rest.

38:01.360 --> 38:02.320
Go back after we eat.

38:03.720 --> 38:04.560
These past six months

38:06.040 --> 38:07.120
in Zhazhating,

38:08.000 --> 38:10.040
aside from Auntie's family, I had no one.

38:10.240 --> 38:11.800
I went to Meng Ruihang's house.

38:13.080 --> 38:14.360
Back then, I naively thought

38:14.360 --> 38:15.440
they'd help me.

38:16.640 --> 38:17.320
And now,

38:18.480 --> 38:19.920
we're supposed to sit together

38:20.640 --> 38:21.560
all happy and friendly again?

38:22.760 --> 38:23.320
Like nothing

38:23.320 --> 38:24.520
ever happened?

38:25.880 --> 38:26.720
Times

38:27.080 --> 38:28.520
really do change.

38:32.880 --> 38:33.600
I know you're upset

38:34.720 --> 38:36.320
about how the Mengs

38:36.320 --> 38:36.960
treated you before.

38:38.040 --> 38:39.320
But that's in the past.

38:40.280 --> 38:41.440
Let's just give each other an out.

38:42.440 --> 38:43.280
We'll still have to

38:43.280 --> 38:44.120
deal with them.

38:50.440 --> 38:51.760
You've already made up your mind.

38:53.040 --> 38:54.000
Why even ask me?

39:08.880 --> 39:10.000
Shouldn't they be there by now?

39:10.800 --> 39:11.440
Here they come.

39:12.000 --> 39:12.600
Mr. Qing.

39:13.040 --> 39:13.720
Ye.

39:14.080 --> 39:14.520
Hello, Mrs. Meng.

39:14.520 --> 39:15.600
Let me take a look.

39:15.760 --> 39:16.440
Hello, Mr. Meng.

39:16.480 --> 39:16.960
Good.

39:18.360 --> 39:18.880
Great.

39:19.360 --> 39:20.240
I can finally

39:20.280 --> 39:21.440
feel at ease now.

39:21.640 --> 39:22.080
Have a seat.

39:22.200 --> 39:23.080
Mr. Qing, sit.

39:23.320 --> 39:24.000
Qing, sit.

39:24.320 --> 39:25.120
- Glad you're back.
- Sit.

39:28.320 --> 39:29.040
Alright.

39:29.280 --> 39:30.320
Let's

39:30.960 --> 39:32.440
welcome Mr. Qing and Ye back.

39:32.680 --> 39:33.120
Here.

39:33.640 --> 39:34.440
- Cheers...
- Bring out the food.

39:35.920 --> 39:36.320
Okay.

39:36.760 --> 39:37.240
Yes, yes.

39:37.240 --> 39:38.240
- Bring out the food.
- Bring out the food.

39:38.760 --> 39:39.960
I'm just a little excited

39:40.080 --> 39:41.080
to see you both.

39:43.040 --> 39:43.720
Qing,

39:44.280 --> 39:45.480
life has its ups and downs.

39:46.040 --> 39:47.280
Thankfully, it was just a false alarm.

39:47.680 --> 39:48.440
That wasn't easy.

39:49.080 --> 39:50.480
This toast is for you.

39:51.040 --> 39:52.480
To your return to the top of your career.

39:53.040 --> 39:54.000
Bottoms up.

39:54.920 --> 39:55.720
We'll join you.

39:58.760 --> 39:59.680
Lately, Ye and I

40:00.280 --> 40:01.640
have really relied on

40:02.520 --> 40:04.080
all of you for your support.

40:05.440 --> 40:06.160
Going forward,

40:06.680 --> 40:07.840
I'll need your

40:08.240 --> 40:09.040
continued support.

40:09.800 --> 40:11.080
Let's keep working together.

40:12.200 --> 40:12.640
Here.

40:13.320 --> 40:14.440
I'd like to toast you all.

40:14.640 --> 40:15.440
Mr. Qing, you're too kind.

40:15.640 --> 40:16.040
Here.

40:16.840 --> 40:17.360
Mr. Qing.

40:23.680 --> 40:24.200
Ye,

40:25.040 --> 40:26.680
why don't you toast Mr. and Mrs. Meng?

40:29.120 --> 40:29.760
Okay.

40:33.960 --> 40:34.560
Mr...

40:35.800 --> 40:37.080
Mr. and Mrs. Meng, let me toast you.

40:38.920 --> 40:39.680
Alright, alright.

40:40.720 --> 40:41.280
Ye.

40:41.480 --> 40:42.480
Have a seat.

40:44.600 --> 40:45.520
Ye, you look

40:45.960 --> 40:47.760
much thinner than before.

40:48.480 --> 40:49.320
You must've had

40:49.360 --> 40:50.440
a hard time

40:50.560 --> 40:51.920
alone in the countryside.

40:52.920 --> 40:54.000
It made me

40:54.080 --> 40:55.880
so worried and sad.

40:57.120 --> 40:58.520
But I'm glad you're back now.

40:58.800 --> 40:59.720
Just look forward.

41:00.960 --> 41:01.640
Look forward.

41:02.720 --> 41:03.800
Thanks, Mrs. Meng.

41:04.760 --> 41:05.840
Actually, I was doing pretty well

41:05.840 --> 41:06.760
in Zhazhating.

41:08.760 --> 41:09.640
It was a

41:10.240 --> 41:11.560
really valuable experience.

41:13.000 --> 41:13.760
And I made

41:14.760 --> 41:15.720
a lot of good friends.

41:16.200 --> 41:17.320
In Zhazhating,

41:17.720 --> 41:18.960
Wu's got my back,

41:19.280 --> 41:19.880
and I've got yours.

41:20.920 --> 41:22.360
Aim for Qingbei University.

41:22.440 --> 41:22.920
Qing Ye,

41:23.320 --> 41:24.000
I believe in you.

41:26.960 --> 41:27.880
I won.

41:30.760 --> 41:31.760
Life's full of

41:31.840 --> 41:34.080
different flavors. Face it with a smile.

41:34.200 --> 41:35.520
Play it right,

41:35.840 --> 41:37.120
and you're the winner.

41:37.960 --> 41:40.440
Every extra day is a gain.

41:41.120 --> 41:42.440
Just being alive is a victory.

41:43.120 --> 41:43.760
Qing Ye.

41:45.480 --> 41:46.880
You're a born explorer.

41:48.440 --> 41:49.440
Time to set sail.

41:50.680 --> 41:52.200
Go conquer your vast ocean.

41:52.680 --> 41:53.320
It's precisely because of

41:53.320 --> 41:54.720
that experience

41:55.480 --> 41:57.080
that I truly learned

41:58.000 --> 42:01.080
who is worth cherishing

42:01.520 --> 42:03.600
and what is worth remembering.

42:06.120 --> 42:06.600
Good.

42:13.840 --> 42:14.480
Mr. Qing, Mr. Meng,

42:14.480 --> 42:15.240
we're heading off.

42:15.280 --> 42:15.760
Alright.

42:17.360 --> 42:18.960
Great wine today.

42:19.240 --> 42:20.880
Button up. It's pretty cold.

42:21.360 --> 42:22.480
Thanks for treating us, Meng.

42:22.520 --> 42:23.600
Come over to my place anytime.

42:23.720 --> 42:24.880
I'll make your favorite dishes.

42:25.280 --> 42:26.320
Next one's on me.

42:26.600 --> 42:27.040
Okay.

42:28.440 --> 42:29.360
Let's get together often.

42:30.480 --> 42:31.440
Let's go, honey.

42:32.120 --> 42:33.320
Mr. Qing, we're going now.

42:33.680 --> 42:34.120
Okay.

42:34.200 --> 42:34.560
Let's go.

42:34.600 --> 42:34.960
Bye.

42:34.960 --> 42:35.840
Mr. and Mrs. Meng, bye.

42:36.360 --> 42:37.320
Come visit often.

42:44.160 --> 42:44.640
Dad.

42:45.640 --> 42:46.960
You go back first.

42:47.760 --> 42:49.160
I want to walk around by myself.

42:51.760 --> 42:52.160
Okay.

42:53.120 --> 42:54.560
I'll have Sun come get you later.
